{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"＼セーラー伊藤ちゃんず／"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2012/12/22/8684059/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日はまひろの家にお泊まりするよ。\nあみもいるよ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"......"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日はレコチョクライブでした♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"♪走れ！Bicycle(ショートver)\n♪会いたかったかもしれない\n♪ぐるぐるカーテン(ショートver)\n♪おいでシャンプー\n♪制服のマネキン"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"32人で踊りました！\n踊れて嬉しかったし、\nめっちゃ盛り上がったし...\nライブ最高"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2012/12/22/8684059/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"沢山のアーティストさんがいる中に\nこうやって出させていただくことは\n本当にありがたいし、\n勉強になります。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂もっとがんばらな！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"......"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"リクエスト2\nなーちゃんとジョジョ立ち"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2012/12/22/8684059/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おまけ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2012/12/22/8684059/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"楽し過ぎていっぱい撮ったから\nまた載せるね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2012/12/22/8684059/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2012/12/22/8684059/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2012/12/22/8684059/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ジョジョ立ち指導の様子"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"若月も指導受けてる"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2012/12/22/8684059/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"3人で撮ったのもまた今度載せるね！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日は名古屋個握"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2012/12/22/8684059/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2012/12/22/8684059/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"やっとまりっ会のみなさんに\n会えるよおおおおおおおおおお！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"楽しみねー♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりか"}],"source":"archive"}